    "The CA file is written to `http.sslCAInfo`. Disabling SSL verification is only suitable for temporary troubleshooting; enterprise networks should prioritize importing trusted CA certificates.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The CA file is written to `http.sslCAInfo`. Disabling SSL verification is only suitable for temporary troubleshooting; enterprise networks should prioritize importing trusted CA certificates."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "CA 文件会写入 `http.sslCAInfo`。仅建议在临时排查问题时关闭 SSL 验证；企业网络应优先导入受信任的 CA 证书。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "CA 檔案會寫入 `http.sslCAInfo`。僅建議在臨時排除問題時關閉 SSL 驗證；企業網路應優先匯入受信任的 CA 憑證。"
          }
        },
        "zh-HK": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "CA 檔案會寫入 `http.sslCAInfo`。僅建議在臨時排除問題時關閉 SSL 驗證；企業網路應優先匯入受信任的 CA 憑證。"
          }
        },
        "zh-TW": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "CA 檔案會寫入 `http.sslCAInfo`。僅建議在臨時排除問題時關閉 SSL 驗證；企業網路應優先匯入受信任的 CA 憑證。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
